sig_mn_c4e03ba104	GDP (Advance Estimate), 3rd Quarter 2026	https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/gdp-advance-estimate-3rd-quarter-2026	U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis	2026-10-29 12:30:00	MACRO	CANDIDATE	[rashid · model=claude-opus-5-5] US Q3 real GDP accelerated to 3.4% annualised from 2.2% in Q2. That reduces the case for Fed easing and supports higher-for-longer US Treasury yields and a firmer dollar. Because the AED is pegged to the USD, the Fed path passes directly into EIBOR and into the cost of Dubai's floating-rate and 2027 refinancing debt. Assuming roughly AED 60bn of repricing exposure and a +25bp shift in the expected rate path, the cost is about AED 0.15bn. A stronger DXY also mildly erodes tourism price-competitiveness against EUR- and INR-based visitors, partly offset by firmer US demand.	-0.15	0	\N	\N	0.85	2	\N	\N	2026-10-29 20:09:39.569	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	b2b1fdfa-5447-40bd-b7bb-6925b9a74a58	Agent Rashid
